nt, SSH, Nazarbayev University, Nur-Sultan, 010000, Kazakhstan."}]}}, {"fullName": "Dossym D", "lastName": "Dossym", "firstName": "Dina", "initials": "D", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Chemistry Department, SSH, Nazarbayev University, Nur-Sultan, 010000, Kazakhstan."}]}}, {"fullName": "Ilyas A", "lastName": "Ilyas", "firstName": "Aisha", "initials": "A", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-7870-9947"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Chemistry Department, SSH, Nazarbayev University, Nur-Sultan, 010000, Kazakhstan."}]}}, {"fullName": "Kuanysheva T", "lastName": "Kuanysheva", "firstName": "Tamila", "initials": "T", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-7558-1802"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Chemistry Department, SSH, Nazarbayev University, Nur-Sultan, 010000, Kazakhstan."}]}}, {"fullName": "Abdizhamil A", "lastName": "Abdizhamil", "firstName": "Altynay", "initials": "A", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-2572-676X"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Chemistry Department, SSH, Nazarbayev University, Nur-Sultan, 010000, Kazakhstan."}]}}, {"fullName": "Bukasov R", "lastName": "Bukasov", "firstName": "Rostislav", "initials": "R", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Chemistry Department, SSH, Nazarbayev University, Nur-Sultan, 010000, Kazakhstan. Electronic address: rostislav.bukasov@nu.edu.kz."}]}}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-2572-676X"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-7558-1802"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-7870-9947"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics", "supporting_data"]}, "journalInfo": {"volume": "244", "journalIssueId": 3349390, "dateOfPublication": "2022 Jul", "monthOfPublication": 7, "yearOfPublication": 2022, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "Talanta", "title": "Talanta", "essn": "1873-3573", "issn": "0039-9140", "nlmid": "2984816R", "isoabbreviation": "Talanta"}, "printPublicationDate": "2022-07-01"}, "pubYear": "2022", "pageInfo": "123409", "abstractText": "More than six billion tests for COVID-19 has been already performed in the world. The testing for SARS-CoV-2 (Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome Coronavirus-2) virus and corresponding human antibodies is essential not only for diagnostics and treatment of the infection by medical institutions, but also as a pre-requisite for major semi-normal economic and social activities such as international flights, off line work and study in offices, access to malls, sport and social events. Accuracy, sensitivity, specificity, time to results and cost per test are essential parameters of those tests and even minimal improvement in any of them may have noticeable impact on life in the many countries of the world. We described, analyzed and compared methods of COVID-19 detection, while representing their parameters in 22 tables. Also, we compared test performance of some FDA approved test kits with clinical performance of some non-FDA approved methods just described in scientific literature. RT-PCR still remains a golden standard in detection of the virus, but a pressing need for alternative less expensive, more rapid, point of care methods is evident. Those methods that may eventually get developed to satisfy this need are explained, discussed, quantitatively compared. The review has a bioanalytical chemistry prospective, but it may be interesting for a broader circle of readers who are interested in understanding and improvement of COVID-19 testing, helping eventually to leave COVID-19 pandemic in the past.", "affiliation": "Biology Department, SSH, Nazarbayev University, Nur-Sultan, 010000, Kazakhstan.", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print-Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["review-article", "Review", "Journal Article"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "Nazarbayev University", "grantId": "090118FD5352", "orderIn": 0}]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Humans"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Sensitivity and Specificity"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Prospective Studies"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Pandemics"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "COVID-19", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "DI", "qualifierName": "diagnosis"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "EP", "qualifierName": "epidemiology"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "SARS-CoV-2"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "COVID-19 Testing"}]}, "keywordList": {"keyword": ["ELISA", "Rapid detection", "CLIA", "Ultrasound scanning", "LAMP", "Crispr", "Ct Scanning", "False Negative Results", "False Positive Results", "Lateral Flow Immunoassays", "Time To Results", "Sars Cov-2", "Covid-19 Tests", "Rt-pcr Of Sars Cov-2", "Antibody To Sars-cov-2"]}, "subsetList": {"subset": [{"code": "IM", "name": "Index Medicus"}]}, "fullTextUrlList": {"fullTextUrl": [{"availability": "Subscription required", "availabilityCode": "S", "documentStyle": "doi", "site": "DOI", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.talanta.2022.123409"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "html", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC8970625"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC8970625?pdf=render"}]}, "isOpenAccess": "Y", "inEPMC": "Y", "inPMC": "Y", "citedByCount": 149, "hasReferences": "Y", "hasTextMinedTerms": "Y", "hasDbCrossReferences": "N", "hasPDF": "Y", "hasBook": "N", "hasSuppl": "N", "hasLabsLinks": "Y", "hasData": "Y", "license": "cc by", "authMan": "N", "epmcAuthMan": "N", "nihAuthMan": "N", "hasTMAccessionNumbers": "Y", "